{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"時事全方位｜神廿四即將升空(一)\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-11-24-13-57-33hEHRsK5T.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】題目：神廿四即將升空</p><p>神舟二十四號載人飛行任務即將於周三升空，中國太空站首次迎來外籍航天員，現時準備工作進入最後倒數階段，今次升空有甚麼看點？</p><p>嘉賓：香港航天學會會長雷健泉</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T06:45:15.105807+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":94,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T05:54:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T21:57:34.501032+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T06:38:42.743940+00:00","content_hash":"192d9b83144d3bbd5e95508cdeae472a53cf4f8da54ae9064b6e670752ca19c0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T06:45:15.105807+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}